WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:01.920
Luke 10

00:30.000 --> 00:35.080
Carry no money bag, no knapsack, no sandals, and greet no one on the road.

00:35.860 --> 00:39.520
Whatever house you enter, first say, Peace be to this house.

00:39.880 --> 00:43.640
And if a son of peace is there, your peace will rest upon him.

00:44.080 --> 00:46.440
But if not, it will return to you.

00:47.180 --> 00:50.940
And remain in the same house, eating and drinking what they provide,

00:51.300 --> 00:53.300
for the laborer deserves his wages.

00:54.440 --> 00:56.300
Do not go from house to house.

00:57.200 --> 00:59.980
Whenever you enter a town and they receive you,

01:00.000 --> 01:04.440
eat what is set before you, heal the sick in it, and say to them,

01:04.640 --> 01:07.360
The kingdom of God has come near to you.

01:07.820 --> 01:10.920
But whenever you enter a town and they do not receive you,

01:11.380 --> 01:13.100
go into its streets and say,

01:13.620 --> 01:18.380
Even the dust of your town that clings to our feet we wipe off against you.

01:19.340 --> 01:23.440
Nevertheless, know this, that the kingdom of God has come near.

01:24.100 --> 01:28.940
I tell you, it will be more bearable on that day for Sodom than for that town.

01:30.000 --> 01:32.380
Woe to you, Chorazin!

01:32.940 --> 01:34.440
Woe to you, Bethsaida!

01:35.080 --> 01:39.000
For if the mighty works done in you had been done in Tyre and Sidon,

01:39.360 --> 01:43.580
they would have repented long ago, sitting in sackcloth and ashes.

01:44.240 --> 01:48.680
But it will be more bearable in the judgment for Tyre and Sidon than for you.

01:49.320 --> 01:53.260
And you, Capernaum, will you be exalted to heaven?

01:53.880 --> 01:56.220
You shall be brought down to Hades.

01:56.980 --> 01:59.620
The one who hears you hears me,

01:59.620 --> 02:02.060
and the one who rejects you rejects me,

02:02.380 --> 02:06.000
and the one who rejects me rejects him who sent me.

02:07.520 --> 02:10.120
The seventy-two returned with joy, saying,

02:10.860 --> 02:14.220
Lord, even that demons are subject to us in your name.

02:15.040 --> 02:16.100
And he said to them,

02:16.820 --> 02:20.000
I saw Satan fall like lightning from heaven.

02:20.900 --> 02:25.380
Behold, I have given you authority to tread on serpents and scorpions,

02:25.380 --> 02:29.540
and over all the power of the enemy, and nothing shall hurt you.

02:29.620 --> 02:34.900
Nevertheless, do not rejoice in this, that the spirits are subject to you,

02:35.320 --> 02:38.380
but rejoice that your names are written in heaven.

02:39.140 --> 02:42.620
In that same hour he rejoiced in the Holy Spirit and said,

02:43.340 --> 02:46.380
I thank you, Father, Lord of heaven and earth,

02:46.580 --> 02:49.780
that you have hidden these things from the wise and understanding,

02:50.180 --> 02:51.920
and revealed them to little children.

02:52.520 --> 02:55.280
Yes, Father, for such was your gracious will.

02:55.900 --> 02:58.860
All things have been handed over to me by my Father,

02:58.860 --> 03:01.900
and no one knows who the Son is except the Father,

03:02.240 --> 03:04.260
or who the Father is except the Son,

03:04.600 --> 03:07.780
and anyone to whom the Son chooses to reveal him.

03:08.740 --> 03:11.140
Then turning to the disciples, he said privately,

03:12.120 --> 03:15.140
Blessed are the eyes that see what you see.

03:15.760 --> 03:19.520
For I tell you that many prophets and kings desire to see what you see,

03:19.980 --> 03:21.220
and did not see it,

03:21.600 --> 03:25.200
and to hear what you hear, and did not hear it.

03:26.980 --> 03:28.060
And behold,

03:28.860 --> 03:31.200
there stood up to put him to the test, saying,

03:31.920 --> 03:35.020
Teacher, what shall I do to inherit eternal life?

03:35.720 --> 03:36.640
He said to him,

03:37.340 --> 03:38.740
What is written in the law?

03:39.200 --> 03:40.460
How do you read it?

03:41.100 --> 03:42.080
And he answered,

03:42.900 --> 03:45.200
You shall love the Lord your God with all your heart,

03:45.480 --> 03:46.500
and with all your soul,

03:46.900 --> 03:48.020
and with all your strength,

03:48.440 --> 03:49.500
and with all your mind,

03:49.860 --> 03:51.220
and your neighbor as yourself.

03:51.840 --> 03:53.080
And he said to him,

03:53.780 --> 03:55.140
You have answered correctly.

03:55.140 --> 03:57.160
Do this, and you will live.

03:57.980 --> 03:58.500
But he,

03:58.860 --> 04:01.360
desiring to justify himself, said to Jesus,

04:02.120 --> 04:03.440
And who is my neighbor?

04:04.220 --> 04:05.260
Jesus replied,

04:05.580 --> 04:08.800
A man was going down from Jerusalem to Jericho,

04:09.020 --> 04:12.740
and he fell among robbers who stripped him and beat him and departed,

04:13.240 --> 04:14.580
leaving him half dead.

04:15.360 --> 04:18.820
Now, by chance, a priest was going down that road,

04:19.240 --> 04:22.520
and when he saw him, he passed by on the other side.

04:23.140 --> 04:25.520
So, likewise, a Levite,

04:25.520 --> 04:27.560
when he came to the place and saw him,

04:27.560 --> 04:29.420
passed by on the other side.

04:30.160 --> 04:33.660
But a Samaritan, as he journeyed, came to where he was,

04:34.120 --> 04:37.060
and when he saw him, he had compassion.

04:38.020 --> 04:40.640
He went to him and bound up his wounds,

04:41.060 --> 04:42.720
pouring on oil and wine.

04:43.300 --> 04:45.080
Then he set him on his own animal

04:45.080 --> 04:47.780
and brought him to an inn and took care of him.

04:48.620 --> 04:51.280
And the next day he took out two denarii

04:51.280 --> 04:53.480
and gave them to the innkeeper, saying,

04:53.960 --> 04:56.700
Take care of him, and whatever more you spend,

04:56.700 --> 04:56.900
I will repay you.

04:56.900 --> 04:58.620
I will repay you when I come back.

04:59.500 --> 05:02.880
Which of these three do you think proved to be a neighbor

05:02.880 --> 05:04.900
to the man who fell among the robbers?

05:05.560 --> 05:06.220
He said,

05:06.900 --> 05:08.240
The one who showed him mercy.

05:09.060 --> 05:10.300
And Jesus said to him,

05:11.080 --> 05:13.200
You go and do likewise.

05:15.000 --> 05:16.780
Now as they went on their way,

05:17.400 --> 05:18.560
Jesus entered a village,

05:18.980 --> 05:21.880
and a woman named Martha welcomed him into her house.

05:22.420 --> 05:24.140
And she had a sister called Mary,

05:24.140 --> 05:26.880
who sat at the Lord's feet and listened to his teaching,

05:26.900 --> 05:30.340
but Martha was distracted with much serving.

05:30.920 --> 05:32.380
And she went up to him and said,

05:33.180 --> 05:37.480
Lord, do you not care that my sister has left me to serve alone?

05:37.840 --> 05:39.300
Tell her then to help me.

05:40.060 --> 05:41.560
But the Lord answered her,

05:42.340 --> 05:47.400
Martha, Martha, you are anxious and troubled about many things,

05:47.880 --> 05:49.840
but one thing is necessary.

05:50.800 --> 05:52.960
Mary has chosen the good portion,

05:53.300 --> 05:55.300
which will not be taken away from her.

05:55.300 --> 05:55.540
And she said,

05:56.900 --> 05:58.640
Mary, you shall come to me,

05:58.640 --> 06:01.180
and I shall also make sure that a person who has not taken from me

06:01.180 --> 06:01.520
is not to see me,

06:01.980 --> 06:02.840
but to seek him at the feet of the incorporator.

06:02.840 --> 06:03.680
So she went up to him and said,

06:03.740 --> 06:03.920
Lord, give me mercy

06:03.920 --> 06:03.960
in this sentence.

06:08.360 --> 06:08.420
And he said,

06:09.480 --> 06:10.040
Completely.

06:10.040 --> 06:11.600
And he said,

06:11.640 --> 06:11.660
You know,

06:12.120 --> 06:13.440
no matter how many people have asked you to offer mercy to others,

06:13.440 --> 06:14.160
it's always就可以.

06:15.100 --> 06:15.120
And we have to gather up all of these tiene where there is no mercy in them.

06:15.120 --> 06:17.300
So there is none but one which there is no mercy.

06:17.680 --> 06:18.400
So let us pray together.

06:18.400 --> 06:18.520
So let's pray together.

06:21.620 --> 06:21.740
So let's pray together.

06:21.740 --> 06:21.760
And let's pray together.

06:21.820 --> 06:22.500
So let's pray together.

06:22.840 --> 06:24.380
Let's pray together.

06:24.420 --> 06:24.560
Let's pray together.

06:24.560 --> 06:25.160
Let's pray together.

06:25.160 --> 06:25.240
And let's pray together.

